(33, 1, 'feb47577-5517-4789-8ef0-d4319c3de6e7', 'assistant', 'I checked the recent transactions, but there''s no field for "outlet" or "cash" specifically in the records. The sales transactions are generally labelled "POS Import", and the payments don''t specify which "outlet" they''re related to.

